s\nto be done:\nएकः सन्दिग्घे कार्यवस्तुनि, Si.;\n(3)\nशङ्कते, आ-, वि-, (शङ्क, c. 1.) (= to apprehend),\nfrom whom (you)\nd. disgrace:\nयतोऽवधीरणां\n विशङ्कसे, Sa.;\n(4) न प्रत्येति (इ, c. 2.) (= not to\nbelieve: q. v.).", "gloss_language": "sa"}, {"gloss": "DOUBT (subs.):\n(1) संशयः,\nwithout d.:\nअसंशयम्,\nSa.;\nI have only one d. about (his) form:\nरूपे मे\n संशयस्त्वेकः, Mah.;\n(2) सन्देहः, he is in d. even of\nour marriage: [आर्यस्य] परिणय एव सन्देहः, Sa.\nv.;\n(3) शङ्का, आशङ्का (apprehension),\nI will\nremove your d.:\nतवाशङ्कामपनेष्यामि, Sa. v.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "doubter": [{"id": "doubter", "headword": "doubter", "headword_slp1": "doubter", "fold": "doubter", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "DOUBTER:\n(1) संशयितृ (m.);\n(2) सन्देग्धृ (m.).", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "doubtful": [{"id": "doubtful", "headword": "doubtful", "headword_slp1": "doubtful", "fold": "doubtful", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "DOUBTFUL:\n(1) सन्दिग्धः (ग्धा, ग्धं), d. as (in\nthis verse): सन्दिग्धं यथा, Kav.;\n(2) सांशयिकः (की,\n कं);\n(3) सन्देहयुक्तः (क्ता, क्तं);\n(4) संशयापन्नः\n न्ना, न्नं);\n(5) शङ्कनीय: (या, यं). To be d.: i. e.\nto have doubts: v. Doubt.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "doubtfuly": [{"id": "doubtfully", "headword": "doubtfully", "headword_slp1": "doubtfully", "fold": "doubtfuly", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "DOUBTFULLY:\n(1) ससन्देहम्;\n(2) ससंशयम्;\n(3)\nसन्दिग्धम्।", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "doubtingly": [{"id": "doubtingly", "headword": "doubtingly", "headword_slp1": "doubtingly", "fold": "doubtingly", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "DOUBTINGLY:\n(1) संशय्य;\n(2) सन्दिह्य;\n(3)\nसाशङ्कम्।", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "doubtles": [{"id": "doubtless", "headword": "doubtless", "headword_slp1": "doubtless", "fold": "doubtles", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss